Package: rustemd
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Francis Lalonde <6190260+fralalonde@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17)
Description: systemd init reimplementation: unit manager + systemctl-compatible CLI
 rustemd is a systemd init reimplementation in Rust: a drop-in systemctl
 replacement with unit files, user services, and timers. Ships the rustemd
 manager daemon, the rustemctl systemctl-compatible CLI, and the rustemd-tui
 terminal client.
